## Day 62 Session Plan (15:43)

### Task 1: Real-time bash output streaming via `on_progress` (self-driven, Gap #1)
Files: src/tools.rs

The #1 competitive gap since Day 38. yoagent already provides ctx.on_progress which emits ProgressMessage events, and prompt.rs already renders those to the terminal. The change: in the bash tool's line reader loop, call on_progress for each new stdout/stderr line as it arrives. This means developers watching cargo test through yoyo will see results in real time instead of waiting for the entire suite to finish.

